  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<p>This War of Mine: Anniversary Edition</p>\n<p>It’s been two years since This War of Mine global release and we’re still expanding the experience. This new free DLC, created especially for the Anniversary Edition, adds new characters, new locations to explore, and most importantly – a whole new ending, leading to a different outcome to the game. The dilemma though remains the same – how far will you go, to protect the ones you care about?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inspired by real-life events</li>\n<li>Control your survivors and manage your shelter</li>\n<li>Craft weapons, alcohol, beds or stoves – anything that helps you survive</li>\n<li>Make decisions – an often unforgiving and emotionally difficult experience</li>\n<li>Randomized world and characters every time you start a new game</li>\n<li>Charcoal-stylized aesthetics to complement the game’s theme</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Included DLCs</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>This War of Mine – War Child Charity DLC</li>\n<li>This War of Mine – The Little Ones DLC</li>\n<li>This War of Mine – Soundtrack</li>\n<li>This War of Mine: Stories – Episode 1 – Father’s Promise</li>\n<li>This War of Mine: Stories – Episode 2 – The Last Broadcast</li>\n<li>This War of Mine: Stories – Episode 3 – Fading Embers</li>\n<li>Forget Celebrations Charity DLC\n</li></ul>\n",
